# Durable scope and conversation context for unattended recovery.
exists su name WordNet sweep run id ob text "wordnet-sense-compounds-62e8847575150acbfc937d30" be text ya
exists su name WordNet sweep artifact directory ob text "artifacts/wordnet-sense-compounds-62e8847575150acbfc937d30" be text ya
exists su name WordNet sweep newspaper ob text "newspaper/wordnet-sense-compounds-62e8847575150acbfc937d30.pya" be text ya
exists su name WordNet sweep command ob text "node command/wordnet_sense_compound_refinery.mjs" be text ya
exists su name WordNet sweep check interval minutes ob num 60 be num ya
exists su name WordNet sweep recovery policy ob text "Check the lock owner and durable artifacts. Recent writes or an active provider duty mean the sweep is still working. If the run stopped or is demonstrably stalled, diagnose the recorded stage and Housekeeper state, make only the smallest general fix with focused tests, and resume the same run id. Prefer a transient systemd user service so the resumed sweep survives the Codex recovery process; verify its main PID owns the sweep lock and produces fresh artifacts after Codex exits. Keep accepted ledgers and evidence append-only." be text ya
exists su name WordNet sweep prior incident ob text "The earlier process stopped near 18:31 local time with a stale lock owner pid. No OOM kill was confirmed. Treat OOM as a hypothesis only; inspect current process, artifacts, host memory, and Housekeeper evidence before concluding." be text ya
exists su name WordNet sweep conversation context ob text "This is the broad frequency-ordered Princeton and WordNet synset intersection sweep, including the zero-tag remainder, to attach uncovered synsets to existing Pyash atoms or create useful two-component compounds. The current pipeline limits compounds to two atoms, filters already linked synsets, preserves canonical accepted links, and writes appendable Pyash ledgers plus a newspaper. Earlier work identified cache retention and repeated whole-cache hashing as memory and batch-rollover risks; those were fixed and committed as 23048f5998e8725c9bae23867fdc9db9b2cfec01. The restarted run had 62,466 remaining at the last recorded checkpoint; read current artifacts for the current number." be text ya
exists su name WordNet sweep invariants ob text "Never start a second sweep while the run lock belongs to the live sweep. Never overwrite or delete accepted sense, compound, progress, translation, composition, or newspaper evidence. Unset PYA_MIND_RESPONSE, PYA_HEAR_FIXTURE, PYA_PIPER_FIXTURE, and PYA_GPU_HOUSEKEEPER_FIXTURE for every real run. Route inference through GPU Housekeeper. Preserve unrelated working tree changes. Do not broaden into unrelated vocabulary work." be text ya
